Z||000005||Slammed Fiero||12-21-2001||08:24 AM||||I don't think it's that unrealistic.<P>I plan to get a solid 300hp out of mine..<P>thats including the 100 shot of NOS ..haha.<P>sorry had too.. <P>Headed to Junkyard this morning to do some shopping.<P>JM ||||reg||1
